193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Modern intelligent systems require accurate perception of their surroundings for automation, navigation, and decision-making. This project combines Arduino-based sensing with MATLAB processing to develop a smart environment mapping system capable of real-time data acquisition, visualization, and analysis. By integrating ultrasonic sensing, sensor fusion, and graphical mapping techniques, the system improves object detection accuracy and enhances environmental awareness for robotic and automation applications.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
