217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (Traditional environment monitoring and mapping methods are often expensive, complex, and require advanced hardware. There is a need for a low-cost and efficient system capable of detecting obstacles and creating environmental maps in real time. Existing systems may lack flexibility and easy visualization of sensor data. Therefore, a MATLAB-integrated Arduino-based environment mapping system is proposed to collect distance data using sensors, process it through Arduino, and visualize the surroundings using MATLAB for better analysis and understanding)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
